        engine_version            = "15.17"
        database_name             = "app"
        storage_encrypted         = true
        deletion_protection       = true
      }

    Note (aws_rds_global_cluster): There is no in-place fix and no CLI
    equivalent. StorageEncrypted is set when the global cluster is created and
    cannot be modified afterwards: remediation means creating an encrypted
    global cluster and migrating into it, which is a data move, not a
